{"repositoryId":1363124656,"availability":"available","full":"WalSplitter/dnd-companion-web","name":"dnd-companion-web","description":"Web app for D&D character sheets — inventory, spells, and stats, backed by an Obsidian vault.","category":"Business","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-09T19:16:49Z","updated":"2026-10-11T12:12:12Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://walsplitter.github.io/dnd-companion-web/","topics":["dnd","npm","obsidian-vault","webapp"],"demo":"https://walsplitter.github.io/dnd-companion-web/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:16.215Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:16.215Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:16.215Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T19:33:16.215Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A D&D character sheet that lives inside your Obsidian vault, and at your Owlbear Rodeo table.","Point it at your vault, a folder on your device or your group's GitHub repository,","and your characters, items and spells turn into an interactive sheet."],"features":["🎲 A living sheet. Modifiers, saves, skills and spell DC are derived, never duplicated. Click any value like 1d8 or 2d6+3 to roll it.","🎒 Slot-grid inventory. Drag items between backpacks and pouches, track charges, and equip gear on a character screen with body slots.","✨ Spells and resources. Slots, mana, class pools, luck points, exhaustion, rests and a biography tab.","📜 Reads your vault directly. Frontmatter and [[Wikilinks]], with hover previews like in Obsidian.","💾 Writes back safely. Edits are patched into the exact YAML key; formatting and comments stay. Failed writes are rolled back."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WalSplitter/dnd-companion-web/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f5bf3a11dec50c19fefe7407a145c0af56db0b7bfd9cfe479cda777647fe4204","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:16.482Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:16.482Z","projectIns